  "details": "There's an issue with certain stations causing the main menu and chatbox to rotate with your head in VR instead of staying in place. I've seen this issue in many worlds, the ones that I know of off the top of my head are:\n\nFISH ! - When you're standing on a boat.\n\nTrash Compactor - When you're currently in a round as one of the survivors.\n\nBump n' Bash: Round 2 - Happens on the moving circular platforms in the map Casted Dream.\n\nThe fact that this affects the chatbox makes it an accessibility issue for mute players like myself.",
